# Warning No. (Hex),Name,Cause,Treatment
00,Normal,Normal,Normal
A0,Over-load warning,Load factor is 85% or more the protection level.,Check the load factor. Set up longer acceleration/deceleration time. Lower the load.
A1,Over-regeneration warning,Regenerative load factor is 85% or more the protection level.,Check the regeneration load factor. Set up longer acceleration/deceleration time. Lower the load.
A2,Battery warning,Battery voltage is 3.2 V or lower.,Check the battery voltage. Replace the battery.
A3,Fan lock warning,Fan has stopped for 1 sec.,Check the turn of the fan. Replace the fan.
A4,Encoder communication warning,The number of successive encoder communication errors exceeds the specified value.,Examine the possibility of the noise.
A5,Encoder overheat warning,The encoder detects overheat alarm.,Check use environment of motor.
A6,Oscillation detection warning,Oscillation or vibration is detected.,Make a gain adjustment.
A7,Lifetime warning,The life expectancy of capacity or fan becomes shorter than the specified time.,Replace the driver.
A8,External scale warning,The feedback scale detects the alarm.,Replace the external feedback device.
A9,External scale communication warning,The number of successive feedback scale communication errors exceeds the specified value.,Examine the possibility of the noise.
C0,RTEX continuous error warning,The No. of detected continuous reading errors (CRC error) of the data delivered to the local node reaches the number specified by Pr7.26 (RTEX warning setup of continuous com. error) warning setting.,Check the setup value of Pr7.26. Check the connection of connector. Replace the cable.
C1,RTEX cumulative error warning,The accumulated number of detected reading errors (CRC error) of the data delivered to the local node reaches the number specified by Pr7.27 (RTEX warning setup of cumulative com. error) warning setting.,Check the setup value of Pr7.27. Check the connection of connector. Replace the cable.
C2,RTEX update counter warning,"Accumulated amount exceeded the times specified by Pr7.28 (RTEX update counter warning setup), so that Update_Counter was not updated.",Check the setup value of Pr7.28. In the host controller to verify that the RTEX_Update_Counter is incremented successful.
C3,Main power off warning,"When setting of Pr7.14 (Detection time of main power off warning) is 10-1999,instantaneous power interruption occurs between L1 and L3 and lasts for a time longer than the setting of Pr7.14.","Check the setup value of Pr7.14. Measure the voltage between lines of connector (L1, L2 and L3).  Connect each phase of the power supply (L1, L2 and L3) correctly. Replace the driver."
